    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷059-五宗世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p004",
    "quote": "臨江哀王閼于，以孝景帝前二年用皇子為臨江王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0200-0101/bce-0153.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
